WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.222
I've come to realize that confidence 
is a&nbsp;concept you can choose.

00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:06.592
I've come to realize that 
authenticity is necessary,

00:00:06.592 --> 00:00:07.607
and it's powerful.

00:00:08.316 --> 00:00:11.728
I've tried to spend time 
being like other people.

00:00:11.728 --> 00:00:12.826
It didn't work.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:15.814
It's a lot of&nbsp;hard work, 
not being yourself.

00:00:16.457 --> 00:00:18.197
I have a few 
questions for you all.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.488 --> 00:00:20.831
Who are you?

00:00:21.942 --> 00:00:23.713
How many versions 
of you&nbsp;are there?

00:00:24.191 --> 00:00:27.180
And I have one final question:

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:30.197
Are you using them all 
to your advantage?

00:00:31.384 --> 00:00:35.117
In reality, everyone is capable of
 creating their own masterpiece.

00:00:35.577 --> 00:00:37.247
You should&nbsp;try it sometime.

00:00:37.247 --> 00:00:41.685
It's quite fun.

